// Name :
"P2997870180" "Dollface"
// ProfessionString :
"P4279649040" "Innocent Little Saint"
// DescriptionString :
"P4178628358" "A sassy little thing, Dollface is completely unassuming and you should have no reason to suspect her of anything.  At all."
// LocationString :
"P2613846116" "Mercy Island"
// IntroString :
"P3541685424" "I'm talking about myself here because I'm being introduced by someone else.  Nonetheless, you should come talk to me, even if you ARE confused to no end."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3219675678" "Meet new contact."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3776541590" "This contact I have introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you have chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3342444154" "I have got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P30252022" "There are a couple of people you should talk to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Complete Text :
"P1246193560" "<color orange>Dollface turns to look at you, but her eyes are completely glazed over. She appears to be completely enthralled by Arachnos now.</color>"
// Page NotComplete Text :
"P1745170713" "I have nothing to say to you, {HeroName}.  I think you would really enjoy not talking to me anymore.  Then I think you should walk away from me.  And I really think you're going to do that right now, aren't you?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


