// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : OGTV_DrGraves_Act1 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dr. Graves 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P450944924" "Dr. Graves"
// ProfessionString :
"P2630529396" "The Eternal Surgeon"
// DescriptionString :
"P771700112" "Somewhere between man and monster, Dr. Graves no longer practices 'formal' medicine.  Practically impossible to kill, since he's technically already dead, Dr. Graves realizes that his name has become the butt of numerous jokes.  However, when he needs a new kidney, spleen, heart, or other 'disposable organs', not too many people take time to appreciate the irony of his career path."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P104308957" "Well, well... {HeroName}.  Have you come by to engage in witty banter, possibly involving a smattering of underlying threats towards my physical well being?  Or perhaps you're simply here to discuss the weather on this bright and sunny day?<br><br>I'll let you guess which of the two that I believe."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1839585814" "I do not know why you have deigned to stop and strike up conversation with me, fellow citizen.  To be fair, I don't care either.  Now scurry along lest I feel the need to inform these fine peacekeepers about how you wish to recruit me into the ranks of Longbow.<br><br>Do you believe they'll stop long enough to ask questions?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3136141033" "You are as described, {HeroName}.  And you took long enough replying to my missive, as well.<br><br>I will make this introduction brief.  I am Dr. Graves, I already know who you are, and we will now get to the point of this meeting.  I have been tasked with offering you the chance at obtaining a great deal of power.<br><br>Usually, that word alone - power - is enough to cause most here in the Rogue Isles to wriggle and squirm in delight.  I'm interested in seeing <b>your</b> reaction."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P535577088" "Do not pester me, {HeroName}. My freedom exists due in part to your efforts, but surely you are intelligent enough to not expect gratitude.<br><br>Where do you think you are? Paragon City?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1390784883" "Our contests will require more attention from you than simply marking the event down on a list as if you were undertaking a grand adventure at the grocery store.  Finish your other inconsequential tasks before bothering me again."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P1326860387" "Dr. Graves seeks you for some unknown purpose. Whatever he's planning, it can't be good... but it might be worthwhile."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P765364897" "Meet Dr. Graves."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2934085037" "I'd watch yourself if I were you. Most of his body parts weren't his to start with."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1043619107" "I'm sure our contest will not be able to hold your feeble attention span for long. I have arranged for someone to keep you busy while I prepare the next event."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ComeBackLaterTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Act3 Text :
"P2509311438" "You are victorious, {HeroName}, but you must remain patient. I shall confer with our benefactor shortly; return to me when you have achieved Threat Level 15. We will proceed then."
// Page Act2 Text :
"P3674229199" "As much as it pains me to say this, I am forced to inform you that you are not yet powerful enough to undertake the next task in the trials.  No matter how amusing it would be to see you fail in a multitude of different manners, I am disallowed to progress you further until you have reached Threat Level 10.  Come back then."
// Page Flashback Text :
"P4053132954" "{HeroName}. I regret to inform you that you have arrived too late. Your window of opportunity has passed, I'm afraid.<br><br>Unless you have some method of time travel I am not yet aware of, I suggest that you leave me in peace. I would prefer that you not remind me of your existence.<br><br><color skyblue>You have become too high level to continue the Hearts of Darkness storyline. If you wish to go back and play these missions, visit Ouroboros (available at level 15) to complete each arc in order.</color>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


