"P3766049399" "Cap au Diable"
// HelloString :
"P3733236999" "I must admit my confusion as to why you so casually address me as if I were someone who languishes down on your level."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1361536826" "I do not know why you have deigned to stop and strike up conversation with me, fellow citizen.  To be fair, I don't care either.  Now scurry along lest I feel the need to inform the fine peacekeepers of the Isles about how you wish to recruit me into the ranks of Longbow.<br><br>Do you believe they'll stop long enough to ask questions?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1988197939" "I hope you're quite proud of what you've done, {HeroName}.  You've managed to lie, cheat, and steal your way to the top.  Were I not bound by my word, I would... but that no longer matters now, does it?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
"P564367717" "This matter is reaching it's conclusion, and yet here I find you dallying about with other tasks?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P78291443" "The level of your powers are quite pathetic, {HeroName}.  How on earth do you expect me to send you on your next... errand... if you can't even fight your way out of a wet paper bag?  Return to me when you're less... inept."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
